{"nodes": [{"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_fragments_extra_powershell_troubleshooting_md", "label": "powershell-troubleshooting.md", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "page", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/fragments/extra/powershell-troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "L1", "display_label": "Note:powershell-troubleshooting", "text": ""}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_fragments_extra_powershell_troubleshooting_troubleshooting", "label": "Troubleshooting", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/fragments/extra/powershell-troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "L1", "display_label": "Heading:Troubleshooting", "heading_level": 2, "text": "## Troubleshooting"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_fragments_extra_powershell_troubleshooting_powershell_5_1_vertical_scrolling_stops_working", "label": "PowerShell 5.1: Vertical scrolling stops working", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/fragments/extra/powershell-troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "L3", "display_label": "Heading:PowerShell 5.1: Vertical scrolling stops working", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### PowerShell 5.1: Vertical scrolling stops working\n\nIf vertical scrolling breaks in PowerShell after running graphify, this is caused by ANSI escape sequences from the `graspologic` library. Graphify v0.3.10+ suppresses this output, but if you still see the issue:\n\n1. **Upgrade graphify**: `pip install --upgrade graphifyy`\n2. **Use Windows Terminal** instead of the legacy PowerShell console \u2014 Windows Terminal handles ANSI codes correctly\n3. **Reset your terminal**: close and reopen PowerShell\n4. **Skip Leiden**: uninstall its backend (`pip uninstall graspologic` on Python < 3.13, `pip uninstall graspologic-native` on Python 3.13+) and graphify will fall back to NetworkX's built-in Louvain algorithm, which produces no ANSI output\n\n---"}], "edges": [{"source": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_fragments_extra_powershell_troubleshooting_md", "target": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_fragments_extra_powershell_troubleshooting_troubleshooting", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/fragments/extra/powershell-troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "L1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_fragments_extra_powershell_troubleshooting_troubleshooting", "target": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_fragments_extra_powershell_troubleshooting_powershell_5_1_vertical_scrolling_stops_working", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/fragments/extra/powershell-troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "L3", "weight": 1.0}], "raw_calls": [{"caller_nid": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_fragments_extra_powershell_troubleshooting_powershell_5_1_vertical_scrolling_stops_working", "callee": "graspologic", "is_member_call": false, "language": "markdown", "context": "graspologic", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/fragments/extra/powershell-troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "L5"}], "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}